To make the condition-specific GI network, we collect all genetic interactions reported in BioGRID 4.4.128 (
32
) between genes constituting condition-specific PPI networks. Finally, we create condition-specific COEX networks between genes forming the condition-specific PPI networks by collecting gene interactions from CoexpressDB v.8 (
34
), whose
z
-score is ≥3, thereby capturing the top 1% of the strongest interactions.
