G
2
matrix as
k
2
-dimensional embedding vectors of SCs. In addition,
S
5
can be interpreted as a transformation matrix, coupling the underlying biology of a cell condition captured by the multi-omics measurements with its SC phenotype. Therefore, to emphasize the connection between the multi-omics data and the resulting SC phenotype, we project the gene embeddings from
G
1
to the space spanned by
G
2
